--[[
    NELY X  --  UI library

    A ground-up redesign rather than a restyle of Nely Lib v3. The API is
    kept source-compatible with v3 so an existing hub only has to change
    the loadstring, but nothing under the surface is shared.

    What is actually different:

      * REAL background blur. Roblox has no backdrop-blur for GUI, so the
        blur is applied to the 3D scene through Lighting while the window
        is open and removed when it closes. That is why the game goes soft
        behind the panel instead of the panel just being see-through.

      * Depth from four cheap layers -- translucent base, diagonal accent
        wash, vertical darkening, and a one-pixel lit top edge -- rather
        than one flat fill.

      * Every tab owns a colour. Selection changes opacity, not hue, so an
        inactive sidebar still reads as a set of colours.

      * CreateItemGrid: a card grid of real item artwork with optional
        badges. Built for picking a weapon skin by its picture instead of
        guessing from a name in a dropdown.

    Plain ASCII only -- executors that read the file as latin-1 turn smart
    punctuation into mojibake inside visible labels.
]]

